Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:25:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [ASTER] Forward integrity APEX file contexts

Provide the com.android.platform.integrity-file_contexts module through the
existing APEX policy discovery location. Forward the context source maintained
under external/aster instead of duplicating its labels in the host tree.

Change-Id: Ice72a7328936edf1e9ef03f820c10e9064590ac8
---
 apex/Android.bp | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/apex/Android.bp b/apex/Android.bp
index eafda15..efcc860 100644
--- a/apex/Android.bp
+++ b/apex/Android.bp
@@ -22,6 +22,11 @@ package {
 
 // TODO(b/236681553): Remove com.android.bluetooth-file_contexts
 
+filegroup {
+    name: "com.android.platform.integrity-file_contexts",
+    srcs: [":aster_apex_file_contexts_source"],
+}
+
 filegroup {
     name: "apex.test-file_contexts",
     srcs: [
